    👉If the race is finished and we don’t have any winner, that means we are too late, so we display
    'The race is over.'. If the race is finished and we have winners, we display them, and we also
    display an alert to inform the user if they have won or lost the bet.

        @case ('FINISHED') {
            <div>
                @if (winners()?.length === 0) {
                    <div>The race is over.</div>
                } @else {
                    @if (betWon()) {
                        <div class="alert alert-success" role="alert">You won your bet!</div>
                    } @else if (raceModel.betPonyId) {
                        <div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert">You lost your bet.</div>
                    }
                    <div>Most Valuable Ponies</div>
                    <div class="row">
                        @for (winner of winners(); track winner.id) {
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-2" [class.selected]="winner.id === raceModel.betPonyId">
                                <pr-pony [ponyModel]="winner" />
                            </div>
                        }
                    </div>
                }
            </div>
        }
    

    👉If the race is pending, we simply display the ponies engaged, and add a class selected on the
    pony the user has bet on.

        @case ('PENDING') {
            <div>
                <div>The race will start {{ raceModel.startInstant | prettyDate }}</div>
                <div class="row">
                @for (pony of raceModel.ponies; track pony.id) {
                    <div class="col-sm-2" [class.selected]="pony.id === raceModel.betPonyId">
                    <pr-pony [ponyModel]="pony" />
                    </div>
                }
                </div>
            </div>
        }
    

    👉 Finally, if the race is running, we use the same template we were using before, with a few CSS
    improvements (a finish line and a flag \o/). We also add the selected class on the correct pony.

        @case ('RUNNING') {
            <div>
                <div style="margin-left: 95%; margin-bottom: 5px">
                    <span class="fa fa-flag" style="font-size: x-large"></span>
                </div>
                <div style="width: 95%; border-right: 3px dotted lightgray">
                    @for (pony of raceModel.poniesWithPosition; track pony.id) {
                        <div
                        class="pony-wrapper"
                        [class.selected]="pony.id === raceModel.betPonyId"
                        [style.marginLeft.%]="pony.position - 5"
                        style="transition: margin-left 1s linear"
                        >
                            <pr-pony [ponyModel]="pony" [isRunning]="true" />
                        </div>
                    }
                </div>
            </div>
        }
    

